    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumwaka wawukoli wetu wamakumi ayedi nakatanu, hakutachika mwaka, hefuku dakakweji damwikumi, mumwaka wekumi nakawana nanaha hatapiluwu mukala, hadena ifuku odu, chikasa chaYehova hichikwikala hadami, hakuntwala kwenoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuntwala mwituŋa daIsarela muyimwenu yaNzambi, hakuntenteka hampidi yasweja kuleha, hambadi yayu yakukabeta kakuchidiilu hadiŋi neyi hakutuŋila matala amukala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakunshikŋa kwenoku. Nami nitali, hikudi iyala, chamwekanayi wudineyi chamwekanaŋa wuneŋu, kuchikasa chindi kudi mwonji wambalawandaniiteti dakweseka nachu; nemani muchisu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owu iyala hakuŋila nindi, Eyi mwana kamuntu, talaku namesu eyi, tiyaku namatu eyi, shaku muchima weyi kuyuma yejima yinukukuleja. Chanakuletuwu kunu analondi niku-leji. Yuma yejima yiwukumona wakayishimunaŋa kudi akwamutaŋa waIsarela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami nitali, kwitala kwanyeŋumuka chipaŋu chamalola kwi-ndo, muchikasa chanowu iyala mudi iteti dakweseka nachu, kuleha kwadu kwashika munkotweli jachikasa jitanu nayimu, nkotweli oyu yakunuŋaku nimukutoha kwachikasa chamuntu. Hakweseka mwatuŋawu, mukutoha iteti dimu, mukuleha kwiwulu iteti dimu nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwinza kuchisu chatala kumusela, hakukandama kuwukandaminu wachu. Hakweseka iluŋa dakuchisu, mukutoha iteti dimu; iluŋa dikwawu dakuchisu, mukutoha iteti dimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tumatala twejima, mukuleha iteti dimu, mukutoha iteti dimu, ejima chochu ho-o. Iluŋa didi hakachi kamatala dashikili munkotweli jitanu. Iluŋa dakuchisu chakwikeki dachisu chatala kwitala, iteti dimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuntwala muchipaŋu chakunsa, nami nitali, hikudi tumatala, nichisesa chamalola chakutuŋila chipaŋu kwi-ndo; hachisesochu hadiŋi matala makumi asatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisesa chadiŋi kumbadi jayisu, kuleha kwachu kweseka nakuleha kwayisu, chochisesa chakwishina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakweseka kutoha kwakufumisha kumesu akuchisu chakwishina, ndo nikumesu akuchipaŋu chamukachi kunzi, nkotweli nkulakaji, nikumusela nikukabeta kakuchimunswa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisu chakuchipaŋu chakunsa chatala kukabeta kakuchimunswa, wesekeli nikuleha kwachu nikutoha kwachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tumatala twachu twadiŋi mbadi iyi tusatu, mbadi yikwawu tusatu. Yishimi yachu nimapwatachu awujiya eseka mwomuchesekelu chachisu chakusambila, kuleha kwachu kwashika munkotweli makumi atanu, mukutoha nkotweli makumi ayedi najitanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninjanina jachu, nimapwatachu awujiya, ninyikoma yachu, yeseka hamu nachisu chatala kumusela. Akandaminaŋaku yimaŋu yitanu nayiyedi; mapwatachu awujiya adiŋi kumesu awu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchipaŋu chamukachi kwadiŋi chisu chatalaŋana nachisu chikwawu, nikukabeta kakuchimunswa nikumusela; hakweseka kufumisha kuchisu chimu nakutwala kuchisu chikwawu, nkotweli nkulakaji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuntwala kukabeta kakuchidiilu, kutala hikudi chisu chatala kukabeta kakuchidiilu. Hakweseka yishimi yachu nimapwatachu yeseka hamu nayikwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimuchisu ochu nimumapwatachu awujiya, mwadiŋi njanina jidi neyi njanina jikwawu kwi-ndo; kuleha kwashikili munkotweli makumi atanu, mukutoha nkotweli makumi ayedi najitanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwadiŋi yimaŋu yakukandaminaku yitanu nayiyedi, mapwatachu awujiya adiŋi kumesu awu; chadiŋi nanyikoma hayishimi yachu, mbadi iyi wumu, mbadi yikwawu wumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchipaŋu chamukachi kwadiŋi chisu chatala kukabeta kakuchidiilu. Wesekeli kufumisha kuchisu chimu nakutwala kuchisu chikwawu, kutalisha kukabeta kakuchidiilu, nkotweli nkulakaji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuntwala kuchipaŋu chamukachi kuchisu chakukabeta kakuchidiilu. Hakweseka chisu chakuchidiilu mwomwesekeliyi yikwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitumatala twachu, niyishimi yachu, nimapwatachu awujiya, mwomwesekeliyi yikwawu. Nimuchisu ochu nimumapwatachu awujiya mwadiŋi njanina kwi-ndo. Mukuleha chashikili munkotweli makumi atanu, mukutoha nkotweli makumi ayedi najitanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwadiŋi mapwata awujiya kwi-ndo, mukuleha nkotweli makumi ayedi najitanu, mukutoha nkotweli jitanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mapwatachu atalili kuchipaŋu chakunsa. Hayishimi yachu hadiŋi nyikoma. Hawukandaminu wachu hadiŋi yimaŋu yitanu nayisatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuŋiŋŋa muchipaŋu chamukachi chakumutamba wakumusela. Hakweseka chisu mwomwesekeliyi yikwawu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nitumatala twachu, niyishimi yachu, nimapwatachu awujiya, mwomwesekeliyi yikwawu. Nimuchisu nimumapwatachu awujiya mwadiŋi njanina kwi-ndo. Mukuleha chashikili munkotweli makumi atanu, mukutoha nkotweli makumi ayedi najitanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mapwatachu awujiya atalili kuchipaŋu chakunsa. Hayishimi yachu hadiŋi nyikoma, mbadi iyi wumu, mbadi yikwawu nawa wumu. Hawukandaminu wachu hadiŋi yimaŋu yitanu nayisatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
