              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyishimi yakuyisu kwadiŋi katala kakweti chenzelu. Kwenoku diku kwakoselaŋawu nyilambu yakushita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.38",
