          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwikeki dachisu kwadiŋi mbadi iyi jimesa jiyedi, mbadi yikwawu jimesa jiyedi nawa, kulonda kujahilaŋahu nyilambu yakushita, ninyilambu yahanshidi, ninyilambu yakutanya.",
          "type": "text",
