          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itala datala kukabeta kakuchimunswa, dawatupristu akwakuhemba lushiiku lwakukameŋa. Wowu anyana kaZadoki, wowu anyana kaLevi akundamaŋa kwakwihi naYehova kulonda kumukalakela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wesekeli chipaŋu, mukuleha nkotweli nkulakaji, mukutoha nkotweli nkulakaji, chesekana mbaŋu jejima jiwana. Kameŋa kadiŋi kumesu etala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.47",
