        {
          "text": "Hakuntwala kwikeki dakwitala, hakweseka yishimi yakwikeki yejima, chimu mbadi yimu nkotweli jitanu, mbadi yikwawu nkotweli jitanu nawa, yejima hohamu. Mukutoha kwachisu mwadiŋi mbadi iyi nkotweli jisatu, mbadi yikwawu nawa nkotweli jisatu. ",
          "type": "text",
